{{Quote|Enables the user to control and create fire, forcing enemies to steer clear of the player if they do not want to burn.|Shop}}
'''Flame''' is an [[Uncommon]] [[Elemental]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|250,000}} or {{Robux|550}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

The Flame fruit grants the user the ability to create, become, and manipulate fire, enabling the use of scorching attacks. These abilities allow the user to inflict high damage and deter opponents, while also causing significant destruction with their moves, with its main rival being [[Ice]].

==Awakening==
Flame costs {{Fragment|14,500}} to fully [[Raids|awaken]].

The {{Title|Flame Fist}} [[Titles|title]] #033 will be granted upon awakening at least one move of this fruit.

