==Trivia==
* Flame model is used in the [[Blox Fruits]] logo, as well as the [[2x Mastery]] image.
* The awakened {{Ability|V|2}} move shares names with a fire spell from [https://www.roblox.com/games/566399244 Elemental Battlegrounds], another game developed by [[Gamer Robot Inc|Gamer Robot]].
<!--- * While holding '''[V] Hell's Core''', It begins to resemble the star, Sol. The firey 'aura' is known as the Heliosphere.
/// What does this mean? Is Sol not just the sun? This feels like it can be reworded heavily. /Limeturtkle
--->
* Flame has been reworked several times in its lifespan, being a fruit that has existed since the game's launch. 
** Some old Flame moves are still used by the [[Demonic Soul]] and [[Head Baker]], as well as the Flame [[Raids|Raid]] boss.

* Flame is the first fruit in the [[Uncommon]] rarity.

